      "type": "physical_space",
      "description": "A neutrally designed and coloured windowless chamber (3.9 \u00d7 3.8 \u00d7 2.5m) with off-white walls/ceiling and off-white/grey floor. Lighting provided by six recessed fluorescent lamp luminaries with prismatic lens refractors. Illuminance was held constant at 500 lux. Air temperature 21\u00b0C, ambient noise 36-38 dBA. Three types of 36W T8 lamps were used: 'Warm' white (3000 K, reddish, CRI 95), 'Cool' white (4000 K, bluish, CRI 95), and Artificial 'daylight' white (5500 K, even more bluish, CRI 95).",
